-# false (final) and nil (unknown) show nothing, as on OpenAustralia.org.au.
- if division.proof
  .proof-notice.alert.alert-warning{role: "note"}
    %p
      %strong This division was loaded from a proof (draft) Hansard, not the final version.
    %p
      Parliament had not yet published the final text for this day when we loaded it,
      so the votes shown here may differ from the final record.
